<h2>Offset</h2>

<p>A data-attribute <code>data-popover-gap</code> argument that offsets the distance between the trigger and Popover.</p>

{{#>_docs-example separated="true"}}
<div class="nsw-list nsw-list--8">
  {{#each model.gap}}
{{>_popover style="dark-outline" icon="info" text="Open Top" id=this id-suffix=../id-suffix position="top" gap=this}}
  {{/each}}
</div>
{{/_docs-example}}
